{"name":"Vengeance and Mercy","type":"feat","_id":"martyrfeat001","img":"icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>At 1st level, the Martyr learns to channel their own vitality into a unique resource. When you choose your Mortal Devotion at 3rd level, you commit to either the Path of the Moon (Vengeance) or the Path of the Sun (Mercy). You have a number of Vengeance or Mercy points equal to your Martyr level × Your Constitution modifier. You do not have a limit at level 20.</p><p>Any excess fades when you finish a long rest.</p><p>You gain points in the following ways:</p><ul><li><strong>Vengeance (Path of the Moon):</strong> When you take damage, you gain a number of Vengeance points equal to half the damage taken, up to your maximum. This gain is applied after resistances or vulnerabilities.</li><li><strong>Mercy (Path of the Sun):</strong> When an ally within 30 feet of you takes damage, you can use your reaction to gain a number of Mercy points equal to half the damage they took, up to your maximum.</li></ul><p>You can only gain a maximum of 7 points per turn.</p><p>You can use these points to fuel various Martyr abilities and spells. When you spend Vengeance or Mercy points, they are gone until you regain them. You can't gain Vengeance and Mercy points simultaneously; your chosen path dictates which resource you use.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Class","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"","prompt":true},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Martyr 1","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":1,"path":"both"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.martyrfeat001","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Martyr's Insight","type":"feat","_id":"martyrfeat002","img":"icons/magic/symbols/question-mark-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Starting at 1st level, your understanding of suffering grants you unique insights. You gain proficiency in one of the following skills of your choice: Medicine, Intimidation, or Religion.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Class","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"","prompt":true},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Martyr 1","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":1,"path":"both"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.martyrfeat002","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Double-Edged Blade","type":"feat","_id":"martyrfeat003","img":"icons/weapons/swords/sword-cross-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>At 2nd level, you learn to imbue your attacks with your life force. Before you make an attack roll, you can choose to take necrotic damage (for Martyr of the Moon) or radiant damage (for Martyr of the Sun) equal to your Constitution modifier (minimum 1). If the attack hits, you add an additional amount of the chosen damage type equal to your Chosen modifier to the damage roll. This can only be used once per turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Class","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"Before making an attack roll"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"","prompt":true},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"1","per":"turn","recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Martyr 2","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":2,"path":"both"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.martyrfeat003","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Martyr Spellcasting","type":"feat","_id":"martyrfeat004","img":"icons/magic/symbols/elements-air-earth-fire-water.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Also at 2nd level, you gain the ability to cast spells as a Martyr.</p><p><strong>Spell Slots:</strong> You do not gain normal spell slots. Instead you prepare blood magics as described in the Blood-Magic Spellcasting table. A Martyr can only cast one bonus action or reaction spell per round.</p><p><strong>Spells Known of 1st Level and Higher:</strong> You know two 1st-level spells of your choice from the Martyr spell list. You learn more Martyr spells as you gain levels.</p><p><strong>Spellcasting Ability:</strong> Charisma or Wisdom is your spellcasting ability for your Martyr spells, this will depend on your alignment to your deity (Moon = Charisma, Sun = Wisdom) and be referred to as your Chosen modifier.</p><ul><li><strong>Spell save DC</strong> = 8 + your proficiency bonus + your chosen modifier</li><li><strong>Spell attack modifier</strong> = your proficiency bonus + your chosen modifier</li></ul>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Class","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"","prompt":true},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Martyr 2","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":2,"path":"both"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.martyrfeat004","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Mortal Devotion","type":"feat","_id":"martyrfeat005","img":"icons/magic/symbols/cross-circle-blue.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>At 3rd level, you devote yourself to a specific path, gaining features at 3rd, 6th, 11th, and 15th level. Choose <strong>Disciple of the Moon</strong> or <strong>Disciple of the Sun</strong>, both detailed in the subclasses.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Class","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"","prompt":true},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Martyr 3","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":3,"path":"both"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.martyrfeat005","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Retribution","type":"feat","_id":"martyrfeat006","img":"icons/magic/symbols/triangle-glow-orange.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Also at 3rd level, your suffering teaches you to respond to threats. When a creature targets you or an ally within 30 feet with an attack, you can use your reaction and expend a number of Vengeance or Mercy points (maximum 5) up to your Chosen modifier.</p><ul><li><strong>Path of the Moon:</strong> The attacking creature takes necrotic damage equal to the Vengeance points spent.</li><li><strong>Path of the Sun:</strong> The target of the attack regains hit points equal to the Mercy points spent.</li></ul><p>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Class","activation":{"type":"reaction","cost":1,"condition":"When a creature targets you or an ally with an attack"},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature","prompt":true},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"@prof","per":"lr","recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"other","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Martyr 3","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":3,"path":"both"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.martyrfeat006","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Exact Vengeance / Merciful Patience","type":"feat","_id":"martyrfeat007","img":"icons/magic/symbols/star-diamond-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Starting at 5th level, you can channel your accumulated resource into a powerful burst.</p><ul><li><strong>Exact Vengeance (Path of the Moon):</strong> After you hit a creature with a weapon attack, you can expend all of your Vengeance points (minimum 10). The creature takes additional necrotic damage equal to half the Vengeance points expended. Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a short or long rest.</li><li><strong>Merciful Patience (Path of the Sun):</strong> After you cast a spell that restores hit points to a creature, you can expend all of your Mercy points (minimum 10). The creature regains additional hit points equal to half the Mercy points expended. Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a short or long rest.</li></ul>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Class","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"After hitting with a weapon attack or casting a healing spell"},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature","prompt":true},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"1","per":"sr","recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"other","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Martyr 5","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":5,"path":"both"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.martyrfeat007","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Improved Sufferance","type":"feat","_id":"martyrfeat008","img":"icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-blue.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Beginning at 9th level, your resilience grows. When you gain Vengeance or Mercy points, you gain an additional 1 point.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Class","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"","prompt":true},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Martyr 9","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":9,"path":"both"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.martyrfeat008","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Blood and Thunder / Sacrifice and Atonement","type":"feat","_id":"martyrfeat009","img":"icons/magic/symbols/triangle-glow-purple.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>At 10th level, your resource expenditure causes a secondary effect.</p><ul><li><strong>Blood and Thunder (Path of the Moon):</strong> When you expend Vengeance points to cast a spell or use a class feature, you can choose one creature within 30 feet of you. That creature takes 1d4 thunder damage. This damage increases to 2d4 at 15th level and 3d4 at 20th level.</li><li><strong>Sacrifice and Atonement (Path of the Sun):</strong> When you expend Mercy points to cast a spell or use a class feature, you can choose one creature within 30 feet of you. That creature regains 1d4 hit points. This healing increases to 2d4 at 15th level and 3d4 at 20th level.</li></ul>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Class","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature","prompt":true},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"other","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[["1d4","thunder"]],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Martyr 10","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":10,"path":"both"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.martyrfeat009","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Indomitable Presence","type":"feat","_id":"martyrfeat010","img":"icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-yellow.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Beginning at 13th level, you can impose your will upon others. As a bonus action, you can choose any number of creatures within 60 feet of you. Each chosen creature must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw against your spell save DC or become <strong>taunted</strong> until the end of your next turn. A taunted creature has disadvantage on attack rolls against any target other than you. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Class","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"1","units":"turn"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature","prompt":true},"range":{"value":60,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"@prof","per":"lr","recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"wis","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Martyr 13","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":13,"path":"both"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.martyrfeat010","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Improved Retribution","type":"feat","_id":"martyrfeat011","img":"icons/magic/symbols/triangle-glow-orange.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>At 14th level, your ability to retaliate grows stronger. When you use your Retribution feature, the amount of Vengeance or Mercy points you can expend is increased to your Chosen modifier + your proficiency bonus. Additionally, the range of the feature increases to 60 feet.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Class","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"","prompt":true},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Martyr 14","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":14,"path":"both"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.martyrfeat011","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Vindictive Divinity","type":"feat","_id":"martyrfeat012","img":"icons/magic/symbols/crown-gold-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Starting at 17th level, you can briefly channel the raw power of your chosen deity. As an action, you can activate this feature. For 1 minute, you gain one of the following benefits based on your path:</p><ul><li><strong>Path of the Moon:</strong> Your weapon attacks deal an additional 1d8 necrotic damage. When you hit a creature with a weapon attack, you can expend 5 Vengeance points to force the target to make a Wisdom saving throw against your spell save DC. On a failed save, they are frightened of you until the end of their next turn.</li><li><strong>Path of the Sun:</strong> Whenever you cast a spell that restores hit points, the healing is maximized. As a bonus action on your turn, you can restore hit points to one creature within 30 feet of you equal to your Martyr level.</li></ul><p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a long rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Class","activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"1","units":"minute"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"self","prompt":true},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"self"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"1","per":"lr","recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"other","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Martyr 17","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":17,"path":"both"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.martyrfeat012","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Apocalyptic Affinity","type":"feat","_id":"martyrfeat013","img":"icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-black.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Upon reaching 20th level, your mastery over suffering is complete. When an ally within 30 feet of you takes damage, you can use your reaction to reduce the damage they take to 0. You then take the same amount of damage that the ally would have taken. This damage cannot be reduced in any way. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Class","activation":{"type":"reaction","cost":1,"condition":"When an ally within 30 feet takes damage"},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"ally","prompt":true},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"@prof","per":"lr","recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"other","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Martyr 20","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":20,"path":"both"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.martyrfeat013","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Hellbent","type":"feat","_id":"moonhellbent","img":"icons/magic/death/skull-horned-goat-pentagram-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>At 3rd level, your bond with suffering makes you resistant to death. When you are reduced to 0 hit points but not killed outright, you can instead choose to regain a number of hit points equal to your current Vengeance points (minimum 1). You can't use this feature again until you finish a long rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Disciple of the Moon","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"When reduced to 0 hit points"},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"self","prompt":true},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"self"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"1","per":"lr","recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"heal","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Disciple of the Moon 3","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":3,"path":"moon","subclass":"disciple-moon"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.moonhellbent","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Bane of Sisyphus","type":"feat","_id":"moonbane","img":"icons/magic/death/skull-energy-light-teal.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Starting at 6th level, you draw power from the suffering of your enemies. When you reduce a hostile creature to 0 hit points, you gain temporary hit points equal to your Chosen modifier + your Martyr level.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Disciple of the Moon","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"When you reduce a hostile creature to 0 hit points"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"self","prompt":true},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"self"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"heal","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Disciple of the Moon 6","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":6,"path":"moon","subclass":"disciple-moon"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.moonbane","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Impending Conviction","type":"feat","_id":"moonconviction","img":"icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-black.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>At 11th level, your words carry the weight of your chosen path. When you make a Charisma (Intimidation) check, you can expend up to 5 Vengeance points. For each point spent, you gain a +1 bonus to the roll.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Disciple of the Moon","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"When making an Intimidation check"},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"self","prompt":true},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"self"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":"cha","actionType":"other","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Disciple of the Moon 11","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":11,"path":"moon","subclass":"disciple-moon"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.moonconviction","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Burden of Existence","type":"feat","_id":"moonburden","img":"icons/magic/death/hand-undead-skeleton-fire.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Starting at 15th level, you can sacrifice your own vitality to ward off death from an ally. As an action, you can touch a creature that has 0 hit points and is making death saving throws. You can expend all your Vengeance points, and the creature regains hit points equal to half the Vengeance points expended. This feature can't be used to revive a creature killed outright. Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a long rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Disciple of the Moon","activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":"Target must have 0 hit points and be making death saves"},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature","prompt":true},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"touch"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"1","per":"lr","recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"heal","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Disciple of the Moon 15","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":15,"path":"moon","subclass":"disciple-moon"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.moonburden","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Aspect of Death","type":"feat","_id":"moonaspect","img":"icons/magic/death/skull-energy-light-purple.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>At 18th level, you embody death's judgment. While you are wielding a sickle, you can use your action to choose one creature within 5 feet of you. This can't be used on undead or constructs. That creature must make a Wisdom saving throw against your spell save DC. On a failed save, if the creature has fewer hit points than your current Vengeance points, it instantly drops to 0 hit points. On a successful save, the creature takes 8d8 necrotic damage. Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a long rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Disciple of the Moon","activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":"Must be wielding a sickle, target cannot be undead or construct"},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature","prompt":true},"range":{"value":5,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"1","per":"lr","recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[["8d8","necrotic"]],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"wis","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Disciple of the Moon 18","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":18,"path":"moon","subclass":"disciple-moon"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.moonaspect","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Undertaker's Sigh","type":"feat","_id":"sunsigh","img":"icons/magic/life/cross-area-circle-green-white.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>At 3rd level, your presence stabilizes the dying. When a creature within 30 feet of you is reduced to 0 hit points, you can use your reaction to stabilize them. They immediately become stable and conscious at 1 hit point, instead of falling unconscious. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Disciple of the Sun","activation":{"type":"reaction","cost":1,"condition":"When a creature within 30 feet is reduced to 0 hit points"},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature","prompt":true},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"@prof","per":"lr","recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"heal","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Disciple of the Sun 3","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":3,"path":"sun","subclass":"disciple-sun"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.sunsigh","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Cusp of Greatness","type":"feat","_id":"suncusp","img":"icons/magic/light/beam-rays-blue-large.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Starting at 6th level, your willingness to sacrifice invigorates your allies. When you cast a spell that restores hit points to an ally, that ally can immediately use their reaction to move up to half their speed without provoking opportunity attacks.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Disciple of the Sun","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"When you cast a healing spell on an ally"},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"ally","prompt":true},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"other","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Disciple of the Sun 6","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":6,"path":"sun","subclass":"disciple-sun"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.suncusp","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Forgiveness","type":"feat","_id":"sunforgiveness","img":"icons/magic/holy/angel-wings-blue.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>At 11th level, your compassion can quell aggression. As a reaction when a creature hits you or an ally within 30 feet with an attack, you can expend up to 5 Mercy points. The attacking creature must make a Wisdom saving throw against your spell save DC. On a failed save, the creature is charmed by you until the end of its next turn. A charmed creature can't willingly attack the charmer.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Disciple of the Sun","activation":{"type":"reaction","cost":1,"condition":"When a creature hits you or an ally with an attack"},"duration":{"value":"1","units":"turn"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature","prompt":true},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"wis","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Disciple of the Sun 11","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":11,"path":"sun","subclass":"disciple-sun"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.sunforgiveness","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Heaviest Matter of the Universe","type":"feat","_id":"sunheaviest","img":"icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-yellow.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Beginning at 15th level, your benevolent aura can impede your foes. As a bonus action, you can create a shimmering sphere of light in a 10-foot radius centered on a point you can see within 60 feet. For 1 minute or until you lose concentration (as if concentrating on a spell), any hostile creature that starts its turn within the sphere or enters it for the first time on a turn must succeed on a Strength saving throw against your spell save DC or have its speed reduced to 0 until the start of its next turn. Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a long rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Disciple of the Sun","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"1","units":"minute"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"sphere","prompt":true},"range":{"value":60,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"1","per":"lr","recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"str","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Disciple of the Sun 15","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":15,"path":"sun","subclass":"disciple-sun"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.sunheaviest","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Radiant Intervention","type":"feat","_id":"sunintervention","img":"icons/magic/light/orb-rays-orange-blue.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>At 18th level, your protective embrace can divert even the most lethal strikes. When an ally within 60 feet of you takes damage, you can use your reaction to absorb up to half of that damage. You take the absorbed damage as radiant damage, and your ally takes the remaining damage. This damage taken by you cannot be reduced in any way. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Disciple of the Sun","activation":{"type":"reaction","cost":1,"condition":"When an ally within 60 feet takes damage"},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"ally","prompt":true},"range":{"value":60,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"@prof","per":"lr","recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":null,"actionType":"other","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"class","subtype":""},"requirements":"Disciple of the Sun 18","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true},"attunement":0,"prerequisites":{"level":null},"properties":[],"weaponType":"","baseItem":"","proficient":null,"attributes":{"spelldc":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isMartyFeature":true,"level":18,"path":"sun","subclass":"disciple-sun"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-class-features.sunintervention","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
